  [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "content": {
        "title_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "1 采样与数据质量"
          }
        ],
        "level": 2
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        95,
        928,
        149
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "content": {
        "title_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "1.1 采样间隔与时间戳"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        163,
        928,
        217
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "采样间隔 Δt 是相邻两次观测时间戳之差。均匀采样要求大多数相邻间隔接近设定值，但网络抖动可能让到达时间偏离采集时间，因此必须区分设备时间戳和服务器接收时间。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        231,
        928,
        285
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "equation_interline",
      "content": {
        "math_content": [
          {
            "type": "latex",
            "content": "f_s = \\frac{1}{\\Delta t}"
          }
        ],
        "math_type": "latex",
        "image_source": {
          "path": "images/601b6a600ec9d103188879e18c33166a9b368ca84ae13fa9bc7eca702b582da5.png"
        }
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        299,
        928,
        353
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "例如每 5 秒采集一次，理论采样频率为 0.2 Hz。判断遗漏记录时应比较时间戳间隔，而不能只统计当前文件共有多少行。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        367,
        928,
        421
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "content": {
        "list_items": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "时间戳统一到同一时区"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "保留原始时间与校正时间"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "记录允许的采样抖动范围"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        435,
        928,
        489
      ]
