  [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "content": {
        "title_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "2 平滑与告警"
          }
        ],
        "level": 2
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        95,
        928,
        149
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "content": {
        "title_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "2.1 移动平均"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        163,
        928,
        217
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "移动平均使用最近 w 个有效观测的平均值减弱短时噪声。窗口越大，曲线越平稳，但对真实变化的响应也越慢。遇到缺失值时必须约定分母使用窗口宽度还是有效观测数量。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        231,
        928,
        285
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "equation_interline",
      "content": {
        "math_content": [
          {
            "type": "latex",
            "content": "m_t = \\frac{1}{w}\\sum_{i=0}^{w-1} x_{t-i}"
          }
        ],
        "math_type": "latex",
        "image_source": {
          "path": "images/f18a97d84ffb0d96b676f75157708a2a81dec2724a4a2d8cc4ecabe22a5f646a.png"
        }
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        299,
        928,
        353
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "content": {
        "image_source": {
          "path": "images/b72ebf3fe8f3e8f54290295f249a15391c55c8c7a677b0caa0594528e672f01b.png"
        },
        "content": "",
        "image_caption": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "图 1 原始读数与三点移动平均的示意"
          }
        ],
        "image_footnote": []
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        367,
        928,
        421
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "平滑后的值适合观察趋势，但不应覆盖原始数据。诊断传感器故障时仍要回查原始读数和质量标记。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        435,
        928,
        489
      ]
