    {
      "type": "title",
      "content": {
        "title_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "2.2 阈值与迟滞"
          }
        ],
        "level": 3
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        95,
        928,
        149
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "只有一个阈值时，读数在阈值附近轻微波动会让告警反复开关。迟滞使用进入阈值和退出阈值形成缓冲区：高于 80 开启告警，低于 75 才解除。"
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        163,
        928,
        217
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "content": {
        "image_source": {
          "path": "images/c19905c3ac4cd095ca273d81019290c8333577dc79889d55af69e6acafa57a69.png"
        },
        "table_body": "<table><thead><tr><th>当前状态</th><th>条件</th><th>下一状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>正常</td><td>值 > 80</td><td>告警</td></tr><tr><td>正常</td><td>值 ≤ 80</td><td>正常</td></tr><tr><td>告警</td><td>值 < 75</td><td>正常</td></tr><tr><td>告警</td><td>值 ≥ 75</td><td>告警</td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "table_caption": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "表 2 告警状态迁移"
          }
        ],
        "table_footnote": []
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        231,
        928,
        285
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "algorithm",
      "content": {
        "algorithm_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "if not alarm and value > 80:\n    alarm = True\nelif alarm and value < 75:\n    alarm = False"
          }
        ],
        "algorithm_caption": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "算法 1 带迟滞的状态更新"
          }
        ],
        "algorithm_footnote": [],
        "code_language": "python"
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        299,
        928,
        353
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "content": {
        "title_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "边界检查"
          }
        ],
        "level": 4
      },
      "bbox": [
        72,
        367,
        928,
        421
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "等于 80 或 75 时的行为必须由比较符号明确表达。测试既要覆盖越过阈值，也要覆盖恰好等于阈值。"
          }
        ]
      },
